- Soil_Type_Count: Feature description: Calculates the number of soil type indicators that are present (value = 1) within a single observation. (numerical), range = [-3.378592779093851, 4.246644424324359], Q1 = 0.3720118570702128, Median = 1.061607153931066, Q3 = 1.7611246852791256, Mean = 1.0000, Std = 1.0000
- Horizontal_Fire_Road_Ratio: Feature description: Ratio between Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points and Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways to identify proximity interplay between fire points and roads. (numerical), range = [0.0, 117200.0], Q1 = 0.4811438856516558, Median = 0.8876205283693979, Q3 = 1.576044784277609, Mean = 7.5746, Std = 665.6886
- Slope_Steepness_Level: Feature description: Categorizes slope into bins (flat, gentle, moderate, steep) representing terrain steepness. (categorical), categories = [flat, gentle, moderate, steep]
- Vertical_Hydro_Road_Interaction: Feature description: Calculates the product of Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology and Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways. This interaction term captures the combined effect of terrain elevation relative to water and proximity to roads. (numerical), range = [-623480, 1656444], Q1 = 9672.0, Median = 51390.0, Q3 = 145446.25, Mean = 106832.3404, Std = 159447.6894
- Hillshade_Range: Feature description: Calculates the range (max - min) of hillshade values at 9am, noon, and 3pm. (numerical), range = [5, 254], Q1 = 68.0, Median = 87.0, Q3 = 110.0, Mean = 92.3297, Std = 33.5512
- Hydrology_Effective_Elevation: Feature description: Calculates the difference between Elevation and Vertical_Distance_To_Hydrology, representing the effective elevation above the nearest water source. (numerical), range = [2136, 3467], Q1 = 2842.0, Median = 3002.0, Q3 = 3137.0, Mean = 2980.7207, Std = 199.3580
- Fire_Road_Hillshade_Comb: Feature description: Calculates a combined feature: (Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points / Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways) * Hillshade_Mean. (numerical), range = [0.0, 21504100.0], Q1 = 93.76652420929848, Median = 170.63230081112454, Q3 = 300.9549361186263, Mean = 1477.2999, Std = 129660.4478
- Soil_Type_Interaction: Feature description: Combines Soil_Type_Count with the Elevation feature by multiplying both. (numerical), range = [-7236.945732819029, 15623.404837089316], Q1 = 1078.090361789477, Median = 3224.1009264886475, Q3 = 5596.854249817061, Mean = 3226.1493, Std = 3161.8133
- Aspect_cosine: Feature description: Applies the cosine transformation to the Aspect feature to complement the Aspect_sine feature. (numerical), range = [-1.0, 1.0], Q1 = -0.4539904997395467, Median = 0.3583679495453004, Q3 = 0.838670567945424, Mean = 0.1880, Std = 0.6852
- Road_Fire_Hydrology_Sum: Feature description: Calculates the sum of Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology, Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways, and Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points. (numerical), range = [150, 13141], Q1 = 3165.0, Median = 4484.0, Q3 = 6217.0, Mean = 4883.7047, Std = 2315.1697
- Wilderness_Area_comb: Feature description: Combines wilderness area indicators into a single feature by one-hot encoding the categorical wilderness areas. (categorical), categories = [Wilderness_Area1, Wilderness_Area3, Wilderness_Area2, Wilderness_Area4]
- Soil_Type_Richness_Proximity: Feature description: Combines Soil_Type_Count with Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology and Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points. (numerical), range = [-9236.186624827908, 17124.279970729414], Q1 = 575.5379971969696, Median = 1946.533420566313, Q3 = 3929.8542200503584, Mean = 2336.5447, Std = 2759.2034
- Fire_Hydrology_Road_Interaction: Feature description: Calculates the product of Horizontal_Distance_To_Hydrology, Horizontal_Distance_To_Fire_Points, and Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways. (numerical), range = [0, 35911015546], Q1 = 225146520.0, Median = 703544813.0, Q3 = 1885568085.0, Mean = 1662819982.7229, Std = 2801304774.9719
- Road_Hillshade_Weighted_Interaction: Feature description: Combines Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways with the Hillshade_Mean, weighted by the Fire_Road_Hillshade_Comb feature. (numerical), range = [0.0, 869564.6666666665], Q1 = 884.1721083976408, Median = 2651.2502829480554, Q3 = 6733.4980050968325, Mean = 6394.3386, Std = 14737.3193
- Slope_Aspect_Climate_Interaction: Feature description: Combines terrain slope with aspect features (Aspect_sine and Aspect_cosine), and Hillshade_Mean to provide a unified view of terrain and climate interactions. (numerical), range = [-11814.236197294844, 6629.671950896272], Q1 = -825.2159012074776, Median = 1127.5996137321474, Q3 = 2633.5493890118964, Mean = 714.2747, Std = 2731.8618
